/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This module establishes the core concepts of Retrieval-Augmented Generation, starting with its fundamental principles and advantages over traditional LLM approaches. You'll explore the complete RAG pipeline from document processing to response generation, while setting up a practical development environment with essential tools like LangChain and vector databases. By the end, you'll understand how to evaluate trade-offs between different RAG implementations and configure basic systems efficiently.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
